de.tsv and es.tsv, used only by the tests, are the 8,000 commonest words of AOSP LatinIME's
dictionaries/de_wordlist.combined and dictionaries/es_wordlist.combined
(https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/inputmethods/LatinIME/+/refs/heads/main/dictionaries/),
each word's frequency f (0 to 255) written as the count 10^(f/32).

